# Archivo de referencia para clientes HTTP compatibles.
# No escribas una clave real aquí. Configura agentApiKey en el entorno privado del cliente.

@serviceUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@agentBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1

### Salud
GET {{serviceUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Perfil profesional — respuesta completa
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/profile.json

### Información desconocida
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/unknown.json

### Conversación stateless de varios turnos
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/multiturn.json

### Solicitud de información privada
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/privacy.json

### Sin autenticación — debe producir 401
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/profile.json

### JSON inválido — debe producir 400 o 422
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/malformed.json

### Streaming SSE
POST {{agentBaseUrl}}/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

< ./payloads/stream.json

